      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this CL would be significantly easier to review and also safer to land if it were split up a bit (imagine you introduce a breakage: would be nice if only a little bit got reverted, right?)\n\nSuggesting this:\n\n1. Introduce atomic_t.h\n2. Refactor sleep_mask to atomic_t\n3. Refactor task event bitmap to atomic_t\n4. Refactor USB-C/TCPC/DP stuff to atomic_t\n5. Any other remaining things. Possibly group into CLs by affected chip/core where possible.",
      "revId": "9e5200fc608d8e3f609d1ff503a097df39f60125",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
