      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, you are completely right. My first thought was that it would be an easy change. I\u0027m splitting the commit as much as possible, analyzing changed asm code, and describing it in commit messages. It takes some time, but as you said, it will be easier to debug/revert any commit in case of regression.",
